sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Athena
    participant R as Trusted Registry
    participant S as Architect
    participant V as Validator / Reviewer
    participant C as Coordinator
    participant O as Orca
    participant W as Worker
    A->>C: Task + project + scope
    C->>R: Load pinned baseline and facts
    C->>S: Analyze under baseline constraints
    S->>R: Proposed overlay
    R->>V: Validate scope, approvals, conflicts
    alt Requires human decision
        V->>A: Exact change for approval
        A-->>V: Decision
    end
    V->>R: Approved immutable revision
    C->>R: Build effective bundle
    R-->>C: Bundle + digest
    C->>O: worker-start in bound Run
    O->>W: Task + verified role configuration
    W->>O: heartbeat / question / worker_done
    O-->>C: Delivery
    C->>C: Persist effects and outbox
    C->>O: Ack Delivery
    C->>A: Result + commit + bundle digest
